config BR2_PACKAGE_DSPAUDIO
	bool "dspaudio"
	help
	  The DSP firmware that dspd runs (services/dspaudio). It needs
	  the C6000 toolchain, so "make dspaudio" at the top of the
	  repository builds it before Buildroot runs; this package
	  installs the image, and the decoder's dspaudio.ddr with it.
